  "description": "The shared library includes common classes for Windows applications using Acapela, Cepstral, CereProc CereVoice, Nuance Dragon NaturallySpeaking, Microsoft Cognitive Services (Azure), Microsoft SAPI (compliant), and Microsoft Speech Platform speech recognition and speech synthesis engines.\n\nCommon classes are used across Chant products: GrammarKit, KinesicsKit, LexiconKit, ProfileKit, SpeechKit, VoiceMarkupKit, and VoiceXMLKit.\n\nDocumentation is available at https://www.chant.net/support/documentation.\n\nNOTE: This is a commercial software product and requires a purchased license for use. Evaluation credentials are available at https://www.chant.net/support/downloads. Purchased licensed credentials are available at https://www.chant.net/store. See https://www.chant.net/products/developerworkbench for more information about evaluating and purchasing licenses.",
